abstract: >-
  IFCtoLBD converts Industry Foundation Classes (IFC) models into RDF
  graphs that use the Linked Building Data ontologies. This is a native
  Python implementation built with IfcOpenShell and RDFLib; Java, a JVM,
  and JPype are not required. The converter supports IFC STEP files (.ifc)
  and IFCZIP archives (.ifczip or .zip), and can write Turtle, JSON-LD,
  RDF/XML, and other formats supported by RDFLib.
